        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an <span class=\"bb_strike\">endless</span>  decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realistic simulation-: </i> <strong>Ready, Launch, and Battle!</strong> Use your spinning top to knock your opponents out or simply out last them in a battle of attrition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-With a twist:</i> But these aren't your regular old battling tops, these ones have <i><strong>abilities. </strong></i>Smash at them with full force, build a wall between to defend yourself, Fly high to the sky and strike and many more abilities to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build the perfect team: </i> <strong>Collect</strong> new tops and <strong>Combine</strong> them together to create your perfect combination and pair them up with a suitable <strong>relic</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We start From the Top: </i>Every time you start a new run, the layout and paths differs slightly every time. Choose paths according to your team and specialty and build the final boss fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/6d57c1d2e018db59b9993875209eaf43.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an <span class=\"bb_strike\">endless</span>  decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/76cfbe3a3c5d94debc8f1308c5470a77.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realistic simulation-: </i> <strong>Ready, Launch, and Battle!</strong> Use your spinning top to knock your opponents out or simply out last them in a battle of attrition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-With a twist:</i> But these aren't your regular old battling tops, these ones have <i><strong>abilities. </strong></i>Smash at them with full force, build a wall between to defend yourself, Fly high to the sky and strike and many more abilities to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build the perfect team: </i> <strong>Collect</strong> new tops and <strong>Combine</strong> them together to create your perfect combination and pair them up with a suitable <strong>relic</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We start From the Top: </i>Every time you start a new run, the layout and paths differs slightly every time. Choose paths according to your team and specialty and build the final boss fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.poster.avif?t=1770121910\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.webm?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585160/extras/52108250d69e24d9fd8aaa677e06f6e1.mp4?t=1770121910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
